cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this audit or its method, please cite it as below."
title: "Fraud model risk audit: discrimination, calibration and cost under a strict temporal split"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible model-risk audit of a credit-card fraud model. Discrimination and calibration are
  reported separately with uncertainty, before and after a strict temporal split; the drift is
  attributed to prior, covariate or concept shift; the calibration gap is priced in currency; and
  a recalibration is fitted on a held-out window and tested on data it never saw. Verdicts compare
  confidence intervals against tolerances declared before the out-of-time data is scored.
type: software
